  "notes": "Sunset Avenue jogs at Glenway: north leg centre x~1695, south leg x~1605, recorded as two T's. Midland Avenue jogs twice: at Rutledge (west part y~3422, middle part y~3105) and at Sunset (middle part y~3101 west of Sunset, east part y~2898). St. Lawrence printed with no suffix. Two streets enter Kreis Avenue from the west plate edge, names cut: '...URY ST.' at y 4755 and '...ENTS AVE.' at y 5295. Unnamed street runs south off the plate from West 8th Street at x~358 (plate edge). McKeone Avenue widens near Glenway (west line curves). Glenway printed 'GLENWAY' (suffix not seen in strip). Brough Street printed 'BROUGH' and 'ST.' separately on the same street (x~390-420). Herman Elsasser and Geo. Vaughan's Estate lettering are estate names. Street at x~2483 (with pipes) lies outside strip+300."
